Here's an example of how to set the background color of an Adaptive Card:

```json
{
  "type": "AdaptiveCard",
  "version": "1.2",
  "style": {
    "backgroundColor": "#FF0000" // This sets the background color to red
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Hello, this is an Adaptive Card with a custom background color.",
      "size": "large",
      "weight": "bolder"
    }
  ]
}
```

